Z||000017||FLASHY||05-08-2001||09:36 AM||||I know I'm setting myself up to get crapped on but I have some neon added to my fiero as well. Around the license plate (RED because the cop told me that's the only legal color to have on the back) and a purple bar inside at the bottom of the rear window. I think it's getting way too easy to call just about anything "rice" now a days. If I'm not mistaken, "rice" for the most part is putting too many stickers all over the car, adding a HUGE exhaust tip, and putting an exaggerated spoiler that doesn't really suit the car. But has anyone realized that usually those "riced up" cars also have bigger rims, low profile tires, lowered, tinted, some bumper and body mods, and fairly nice paint jobs....hmmmmm sounds like we're talking about many of us fiero fanatics. And I don't know about where everyone else lives but around here there are just as many...in fact more cars (from what I've seen) that are NOT considered rice cars whatsoever with neon lights. (eg. sunfires, mustangs, dodge/GMC trucks, jeeps,...which are all stock mind you). I'm getting tired of this "rice" accusation all the time. I think it has something to do with feeling a bit insecure with the fact that "rice mobiles" get just as many stares as the rest of the nice stock cars (Ooooo I can feel the flames starting to rise). What's the point anyway, everyone has their own personal tastes so why is anybody's opinion superior over anyone else's? Who cares, let them like their style and you can like your style (not directed to anyone particular). That way we are not all the same. I hate the 'I'm better than you because I say so' type things because it's not true.<P>Anyway, let's just answer the poor guy's question and stop criticizing him for his own tastes. If he wanted to be bugged then he'd asked to be bugged. Oh, and I'm not asking to be bugged either as I'm sure there are some who would like to stick my neon in places not thought possible right about now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000018||JSocha||05-08-2001||09:45 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cozmo:<BR><B>What's wrong with cheap flashy underpants???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nothing, as I myself would consider edible undies flashy.<P>But, imagine this picture if you will...a 500 pound woman, wearing nothing but edible undies.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Some common side effects that have been reported include nausea, sleeplessness, nightmares, panic attacks, hysteria, impotence...<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha.jpg"> ||||reg||1
